wqdb =======================================
c, continue   continue
n, next       step over
s, step       step in
fin, finish   step out
b <pc>        add breakpoint in current chunk
ib            show breakpoints
rs            reset breakpoints
track <name>  track current local by name, or global if no local matches
track global <name>
track local <name>
track capture <slot>
tracks        show symbol trackers
untrack <id|all>
gb, globals   dump globals
lb, locals    dump locals
bt            show backtrace
p, peek <n>   peek +-n lines (def=3)
i, ins <n>    peek +-n insts (def=5)
h, help       show this help
